            <div xml:id="d749">

                <pb facs="0786" n="778" sameAs="frus:frus1939v02/pg778"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/9199: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Matthews</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San
                                Sebastian</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-05-15T09:00:00+01:00">May 15, 1939—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 15—7:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>50. I have been invited along with other Chiefs of Mission to attend the victory
                    celebrations. As they are now expected to take place on the 19th and 20th I
                    propose unless otherwise instructed to leave here for Madrid Wednesday noon
                    stopping off at Burgos for discussions at the Foreign Office en route.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthews</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
